re staying private and independent  longer than ever before  whether europe will eventually become  the most innovative region on the planet  and keep very ambitious europeans on  home soil  is a question that a few college  students with a small youtube channel  cannot tell you however we can tell you  of absolute certainty  that it would be a lie to say that  europe lacks the potential  [Music]  you

